/**!
 * Room-N-Spheres
 *
 * Submission for #WCCChallenge "Shadow Math"
 *
 * Experimenting with p5.js WEBGL mode.
 *
 * Press [SPACE] to toggle loop
 * Press [S] to save frame
 *
